{"additions":476,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\n\nCloses #162.\n\n- **Horizontal scroll** — `h` / `l` (`←` / `→`) scroll long lines in the preview by 8 columns, clamped to the longest shown line; nothing wraps and the line number gutter stays put. `Back` (the old `h` meaning) is still an action for user configs but is unbound by default — `Esc` and `Tab` reach the list, and `h` / `l` now mean the same thing as in the diff view.\n- **Content search** — `preset \"search\"` on `pane \"preview\"`: `/` searches what is shown (the rendered Markdown in render mode, the raw lines otherwise), case-insensitive, one match per occurrence. Matches are highlighted (current one in the diff view's orange), `n` / `N` step through them, and the view scrolls vertically *and* horizontally so the current match is visible — including while typing. `Esc` clears the search first, then returns to the list. Image previews are out of scope.\n- `SearchMatch::TextLine { row, col_start, col_end }` (char columns) joins `ListEntry` / `DiffLine`; `SearchMatch` now derives `PartialEq`. The Files page only reloads the preview after a jump when the search came from the file list.\n\n## Docs / demo\n\n- README en/ja, guide Files chapter (\"Reading long files\") and key tables, Config Reference preview rows.\n- `tape/demo-files.tape`: the demo README gets one long line; the preview scene now searches `/reveal`, scrolls with `l` / `h` and clears with `Esc`; GIF re-recorded.\n\n## Tests\n\nMatch collection (raw + rendered Markdown), jump scroll-into-view both ways, horizontal scroll clamping, and the shift/highlight span rewrite. 382 tests green, clippy clean.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Qxrr9mRdnw87JU1D28bRQo","changedFiles":12,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-07T09:01:25Z","deletions":32,"headRefName":"feat/files-preview-search","labels":[],"number":167,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMcbncA","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThe preview content search implementation has a confirmed Unicode case-folding offset bug and the new horizontal-scroll clamping path introduces avoidable per-render allocations that can degrade performance on large previews.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nThis PR enhances the Files page preview pane by adding diff-view-like horizontal scrolling and enabling content search within the previewed text (raw lines or rendered Markdown), aligning behavior and keybindings with existing search/scroll infrastructure in `core::search` / `core::pane`.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Add horizontal scrolling (`h`/`l`, `←`/`→`) in the Files preview pane, with clamping to the longest visible line.\n- Add preview content search (`/`, `n`, `N`) with match highlighting and scroll-into-view (vertical + horizontal).\n- Update default config, docs (EN/JA), and the Files demo tape/GIF to reflect the new behavior.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tape/demo-files.tape | Updates the demo script to show preview searching and horizontal scrolling. |\r\n| src/files/state.rs | Adjusts post-jump behavior so only file-name search jumps resync/reload the preview. |\r\n| src/files/panes/preview.rs | Implements preview horizontal scrolling, content search match collection/jumping, and highlighting in raw/Markdown modes. |\r\n| src/core/search.rs | Extends `SearchMatch` with `TextLine` and derives `PartialEq/Eq` for testability/comparisons. |\r\n| README.md | Updates Files view key table for new preview scroll/search behavior. |\r\n| docs/README.ja.md | Japanese README key table updates for preview scroll/search behavior. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-files.md | Adds guidance/key table updates for reading long files and searching in preview. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/config-reference.md | Updates config reference to document preview pane’s `search` preset and new actions. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-files.md | Japanese guide updates mirroring the Files preview scroll/search additions. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/config-reference.md | Japanese config reference updates for preview pane search/scroll actions. |\r\n| assets/demo-files.gif | Re-recorded demo GIF (LFS pointer updated). |\r\n| assets/default.kdl | Updates default keybindings for Files preview pane (adds `search` preset; binds h/l to hscroll). |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 12/12 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 2\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-09-07T09:06:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"e854822d8f3b434a48394590f186073c3b33efa1"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMceysQ","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-09-07T09:10:54Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"e854822d8f3b434a48394590f186073c3b33efa1"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMce0HQ","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-09-07T09:10:56Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"8828c946d72fb5bca100105ee049f05b49f95089"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMcizBA","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nPreview rendering currently scales poorly with many search matches (per-row filtering over the full match list), and a few key tables omit documented arrow-key bindings for horizontal scroll.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 12/12 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 5\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>","submittedAt":"2026-09-07T09:16:17Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"8828c946d72fb5bca100105ee049f05b49f95089"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-07T09:18:57Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34105310822/job/101688856696","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-09-07T09:18:58Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-07T09:12:21Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34104569417/job/101686514889","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-07T09:11:00Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-07T09:11:38Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34104569421/job/101686514706","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-09-07T09:11:01Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-07T09:12:07Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34104569417/job/101686514652","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-09-07T09:11:03Z","stat